#: templates/about.html:4 templates/layout.html:34
msgid "About"
msgstr "關於"

#: templates/about.html:5
msgid "What is this?"
msgstr "這是什麼？"

#: templates/about.html:7
msgid ""
"This tool, called Signatures, is designed to find technical issues in "
"custom user signatures. It was written in Python by "
"User:AntiCompositeNumber."
msgstr ""
"這個工具名為 Signatures，旨在檢測自訂使用者簽名中的技術問題。它由 User:AntiCompositeNumber 以 Python "
"編寫。"

#: templates/about.html:12
msgid "Why does this exist?"
msgstr "為什麼會存在這個工具？"

#: templates/about.html:14
#, python-format
msgid ""
"MediaWiki has never imposed technical restrictions on fancy signatures "
"other than maximum length. This allowed editors to create complex "
"signatures that are hard for machines to parse. Complex signatures "
"sometimes contained mistakes that would affect other text. A "
"%(proposal)sproposal%(close)s was created for technical requirements that"
" would fix these issues."
msgstr ""
"MediaWiki 從未對花式簽名實施除了長度上限之外的技術限制。這使得編輯者能 "
"建立難以被機器解析的複雜簽名。複雜的簽名有時會包含會影響其他文字的錯誤。 因此建立了一份 "
"%(proposal)s提案%(close)s，內容為修正這些問題的技術要求。"

#: templates/about.html:27
msgid ""
"This tool was created as a result of that proposal so that editors "
"discussing the proposal could make informed comments. It may also be "
"useful in notifying users about their problematic signatures."
msgstr "這個工具正是因應該提案而誕生，讓討論該提案的編輯者能做出明智的評論。它 也可用來通知使用者其有問題的簽名。"

#: templates/about.html:33
msgid "What problems are detected?"
msgstr "會檢測哪些問題？"

#: templates/about.html:35
msgid ""
"As this tool was built to collect data about the proposed new "
"requirements, it checks for signatures that would violate those "
"requirements."
msgstr "由於這個工具是為了蒐集關於新規範要求的資料而建立，因此會檢查簽名是否 會違反這些要求。"

#: templates/about.html:40
msgid "The following problems are detected:"
msgstr "會檢測下列問題："

#: templates/about.html:43
#, python-format
msgid "Any %(lintopen)sLint errors%(close)s"
msgstr "任何 %(lintopen)sLint 錯誤%(close)s"

#: templates/about.html:51
msgid ""
"Missing or invalid links to user, user talk, and contributions pages, "
"including signatures with"
msgstr "缺少或無效的使用者、使用者討論、貢獻頁連結，包含下列情況："

#: templates/about.html:56
msgid "No user links at all"
msgstr "完全沒有使用者連結"

#: templates/about.html:58
msgid "Only links to the user, user talk, or contributions page of someone else"
msgstr "只連到其他人的使用者頁、討論頁或貢獻頁"

#: templates/about.html:63
msgid "Only links to a user page on another wiki"
msgstr "只連到另一個 Wiki 的使用者頁"

#: templates/about.html:66
msgid "Fancy signatures without any formatting"
msgstr "沒有任何格式化的花式簽名"

#: templates/about.html:68
msgid "Signatures longer than 255 characters (before substitution)"
msgstr "長度超過 255 個字元的簽名（替換前）"

#: templates/about.html:72
msgid "Signatures that change when the page is saved again"
msgstr "重新儲存頁面後內容會改變的簽名"

#: templates/about.html:75
msgid "My signature works fine, why did the tool find problems?"
msgstr "我的簽名可以正常顯示，為什麼工具卻找到問題？"

#: templates/about.html:78
msgid ""
"Some lint errors reported by the tool may not currently affect the "
"rendered output of the page. Some are deprecated tags that may not be "
"supported by browsers in the future, while others are silently fixed by "
"the wikitext rendering system. There is no way to guarentee that these "
"lint errors will continue to work over time."
msgstr ""
"工具報告的某些 Lint 錯誤目前可能不會影響頁面的渲染結果。有些是已棄用的標籤， 未來可能不再被瀏覽器支援；另一些則可能被 wikitext "
"渲染系統悄悄修正。無法保證 這些 Lint 錯誤日後仍然可持續正常運作。"

#: templates/about.html:87
msgid ""
"Other reported errors are a result of requirements that don't target the "
"rendered version of a page. These requirements are designed to make it "
"easier for machines to find and parse signatures. If these problems are "
"not fixed, tools, scripts, and bots may not work correctly with your "
"signature."
msgstr ""
"其他報告的錯誤則是因為規範要求不是針對頁面的渲染版本，而是為了讓機器更容易 "
"找到並解析簽名。若這些問題不修正，工具、腳本與機器人可能無法正確處理你的簽名。"

#: templates/about.html:95
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Some reported issues are false positives caused by bugs in the detection "
"code. You should report these bugs to AntiCompositeNumber on "
"%(talkopen)stheir talk page%(close)s or on %(ghopen)sGitHub%(close)s."
msgstr ""
"有些回報問題是偵測程式中的錯誤所造成的誤判。你應該將這些錯誤回報給 AntiCompositeNumber，方式可透過 "
"%(talkopen)s他們的討論頁%(close)s 或 %(ghopen)sGitHub%(close)s。"

#: templates/about.html:105
msgid "Where's the data for my home wiki?"
msgstr "我的首頁 Wiki 的資料在哪裡？"

#: templates/about.html:107
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, site-level reports usually take too long to be able to "
"generate them on the fly. The single user tool works for all Wikimedia "
"wikis though. If you would like the report for a wiki to be created, "
"please contact AntiCompositeNumber."
msgstr ""
"很遺憾，站點層級的報告通常需要太長時間，因此無法即時產生。但單一使用者工具 可在所有 Wikimedia Wiki 上使用。若你希望建立某個 "
"Wiki 的報告，請聯絡 AntiCompositeNumber。"

#: templates/about.html:113
msgid "I'd like to do something more with the data"
msgstr "我想對這些資料做更多處理"

#: templates/about.html:116
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The tool has a basic REST API, documented %(apiopen)shere%(close)s. It "
"should not be considered especially stable."
msgstr "此工具提供基礎的 REST API，文件可見 %(apiopen)s這裡%(close)s。它不應被視為高度穩定。"

